                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hill to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                            Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-03-28"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">March 28, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Turkey has signed but not ratified all three Hague conventions and is not
                    represented permanent court or administrative council. Turkey is the only
                    signatory that has not ratified and has been notified by the Netherlands that
                    until she has ratified she can not participate in the revision of the treaties
                    or discussions. Difference between Turkey and nonsignatories is that Turkey has
                    only to ratify while others can accomplish adherence only under article 60,
                    convention of arbitration. Netherlands is waiting for Russia to name date of
                    conference.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
